# AI-BOS Blueprint Binding (blueprints/)

When working under `blueprints/`, treat the delivery project as **`PRJ-BP-WEB-001`**.

## Mandatory

1. Read `AI-BOS/project-registry/registry.json` entry `PRJ-BP-WEB-001` before material changes.
2. Load Blueprint domain pack: `HB-DLV-BP-001`, `WF-BLUEPRINT-FACTORY-001`, `RU-AI-BOS-BP-001`.
3. Follow 12-stage pipeline via `bp-director` / `@website-blueprint-factory` (`AG-BP-DIR-001`).
3. Record evidence in `.cursor/execution/template-tasks.md`.
4. **No code or HTML** — markdown blueprints only.

## Routing

| Need | Agent |
|------|-------|
| Orchestrator | `bp-director` (`AG-BP-DIR-001`) |
| Stages 01–12 | `bp-01` … `bp-12` (`AG-BP-STG-001` … `AG-BP-STG-012`) |
| Uniqueness gate | `bp-11-uniqueness-enforcer` (`AG-BP-STG-011`, advisory) |
| AI-BOS structural change | `@system-builder` |

## Never

- Skip strategy stages and jump to visual design
- Emit HTML or application code from blueprint factory
